                    Photo Gallery & Highlights
                </span>
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-black text-white group-hover:text-cyan-400 transition font-poppins">Explore Camp Days Gallery</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs sm:text-sm">Check out day-by-day session photos, instructor moments, and the final wrap-up.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-cyan-400 group-hover:bg-cyan-500 group-hover:text-slate-950 text-xl transition shrink-0 shadow-lg">
